<!--
	Notification small icon: the rhubarb silhouette (feature-spec §6a).

	This is the flat-fill twin of the ic_currency artwork. The in-app currency icon is now the full-colour
	render in drawable-*dpi, but a notification small icon cannot be that: Android discards the colours and
	draws the icon as a solid tinted mask, so a photographic source collapses into a blob. Hence a
	single-colour vector kept alongside it.

	Two stalks under a broad, deeply lobed leaf. The lobes are exaggerated well past life size because the
	whole thing is a single flat fill at status-bar size: the silhouette is the only cue there is, and a
	smooth leaf at that size is just an oval.
-->
